{% doc %}
  Shopify Theme Store release version — output ONLY.

  Bumped manually via `yarn theme:bump-store-version <ver>` on each
  store release (independent of the internal git-tag version in
  `package.json`/CHANGELOG.md that increments per commit).

  This file is `merge=ours` in `.gitattributes`: each fork ships its
  own store version line and `yarn core:sync` never overwrites it.
{% enddoc -%}
